From: LeoDeadware <351117497+LeoDeadware@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:00:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/26] present pacing: display sync + 1/60 min duration, 60.00
 Hz vblank phase-locked to the display (+9 ms), [present] presentedTime stats;
 front end fitted whole (pillarbox), draw distance and offscreen scale 1.0

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
